        "TileImage": "$($repository 05fa1c73-1f74-4620-8d85-b0aab8455c30).Image",
        "Description": "Congratulations on passing the first stage of the Agent Requalification Program.\rAs you know, some clients want to send a message, often requesting specific and highly brutal methods of execution. Several of our agents struggle with this, particularly when targets are difficult to approach. \rThis exercise has been designed to evaluate your ability to perform such executions cleanly and efficiently, as well as your exfiltration abilities. Creative maneuvering and tricks may be required.\rGood luck",
